<area shape="poly" id="node3" href="girls4foursTaft.html" title="Taft" alt="" coords="318,29,316,22,311,15,303,10,293,7,282,5,271,7,261,10,253,15,248,22,246,29,248,37,253,43,261,49,271,52,282,53,293,52,303,49,311,43,316,37"/>
<area shape="poly" id="edge2" href="https://www.row2k.com/results/resultspage.cfm?UID=D851EE8CBA7B651F2624CFCB66A81A2D&amp;cat=5" title="NEIRA Boys &amp; Girls Fours,Berkshire, Choate, Frederick Gunn School, Greenwich Academy, Ms. Porter&#39;s, Taft			
Distance: 1500 Conditions: Racing started out with a light port&#45;side crosswind breeze from approximately 400m–750m for the lower boats, but the water remained quite protected. By third boat races, the crosswind started to reform into a true tail down the course, still leaving the water relatively protected for most of the race, with some very light chop in the final 500. Comments: In the G1 event, Porter&#39;s caught a crab near the final 500 that nearly stopped the boat, but the crew recovered admirably and raced hard to the finish.
Note that in the interest of time for NEIRA seeding, these results temporarily omit the G5 and GN race, as there is a delay in compiling data for those early races. G5 and GN will be updated in short order.
None" alt="" coords="266,49,248,86,245,104,251,120,266,135,285,149,280,149,262,139,247,123,240,104,243,85,263,53"/>
